          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sharp increases in marine and energy insurance premiums and reductions in coverage availability for Middle East routes push Western partners to establish pooled underwriting, common risk-sharing mechanisms and joint logistics protocols, which increase institutional integration capacity." />
