          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained high-volume transfers of arms to Ukraine force recipient governments to harmonize export controls, certification and logistics procedures with partners, increasing institutional capacity to integrate policies and administration." />
