          <attvalue for="35" value="Escalating US–China geopolitical friction increases state-linked cyber and covert operations aimed at maritime traffic-management systems (AIS, VTS) and port infrastructure, producing temporary closures, navigation slowdowns, or reduced throughput at key chokepoints." />
