          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising strategic tension between the US and China increases market risk premia and speculative positioning in oil and refined-fuel futures as traders price higher odds of supply disruptions, producing upward pressure on global fuel prices." />
