          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising US–China strategic friction forces allied governments to reallocate diplomatic and operational attention and to adopt divergent economic/security stances, stressing Western political and operational unity on Russia policy and reducing alliance cohesion." />
