          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="The emergence of advanced counter‑space capabilities by a strategic competitor drives affected states to coordinate and converge their diplomatic positions and collective policies within allied unions to present a unified deterrent and response posture." />
