          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sustained increase in domestic production of space defense systems prompts unilateral export controls, security screening and procurement offsets that create divergence from external regulatory standards and reduce harmonization with partner regimes." />
