          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Improved institutional integration (streamlined joint procurement, shared regulatory approval processes and coordinated R&amp;D financing) directly accelerates allied fab project deliveries and equipment installation rates, raising allied advanced semiconductor production capacity." />
